graph TD
    Req["incoming request<br/>from check_ip"]
    HostCheck{"host bucket<br/>(/32, capacity 5,<br/>refill 1/sec)<br/>token available?"}
    NetCheck{"netblock bucket<br/>(/24, capacity 20,<br/>refill 5/sec)<br/>token available?"}
    Deny1["deny<br/>'host limit exceeded'"]
    Deny2["deny<br/>'netblock limit exceeded'"]
    Allow["allow<br/>both buckets decremented"]

    Req --> HostCheck
    HostCheck -->|no, host token spent| Deny1
    HostCheck -->|yes, consume 1 host token| NetCheck
    NetCheck -->|no, netblock token spent| Deny2
    NetCheck -->|yes, consume 1 netblock token| Allow
